{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 6759131735967682920,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Triagebot",
      "source_hash": 12651343996123335252,
      "context_hash": 15569816102645184874,
      "translation": "Triagebot",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962778Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Triagebot (AKA rustbot) is a general-purpose bot used for a wide variety of tasks in the rust-lang organization, usually involving sending commands via GitHub or Zulip comments.",
      "source_hash": 7850777922225121969,
      "context_hash": 16656446768398382808,
      "translation": "Triagebot(rustbot이라고도 함)는 rust-lang 조직에서 다양한 작업에 사용되는 범용 봇으로, 보통 GitHub나 Zulip 댓글을 통해 명령을 전송하는 방식으로 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot",
        "Zulip": "Zulip",
        "rustbot": "rustbot",
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962779Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The following pages explain the available features.",
      "source_hash": 11827466802895653181,
      "context_hash": 7882346779812244922,
      "translation": "다음 페이지에서는 사용 가능한 기능을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Commands are usually issued by writing comments starting with the text `@rustbot`.",
      "source_hash": 14199946795531190450,
      "context_hash": 9809874580777941265,
      "translation": "명령은 보통 `@rustbot`이라는 텍스트로 시작하는 댓글을 작성하여 실행합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "The commands that are available depends on which repository you are using.",
      "source_hash": 17939014070421536387,
      "context_hash": 13323293555202770580,
      "translation": "사용 가능한 명령은 사용 중인 저장소에 따라 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "Each repository has a `triagebot.toml` where you can see which features are enabled.",
      "source_hash": 16812685357884897752,
      "context_hash": 2932900019750448001,
      "translation": "각 저장소에는 `triagebot.toml`이 있으며, 여기서 어떤 기능이 활성화되어 있는지 확인할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "For example, the following comment:",
      "source_hash": 6622193814834436622,
      "context_hash": 16533595087561428989,
      "translation": "예를 들어 다음과 같은 댓글은:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "will set the given labels on a GitHub issue or pull request, even for people who don't have direct permissions to do that in the GitHub UI.",
      "source_hash": 5196732192123302391,
      "context_hash": 1816906305346680511,
      "translation": "GitHub UI에서 직접 권한이 없는 사람도 GitHub 이슈나 풀 리퀘스트에 지정된 라벨을 설정할 수 있게 해줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "issue": "이슈",
        "pull request": "풀 리퀘스트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "GitHub commands",
      "source_hash": 11585341066511702117,
      "context_hash": 10669550028629344403,
      "translation": "GitHub 명령",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Commands on GitHub issues or pull requests are usually issued by writing `@rustbot` followed by the command anywhere in the comment. `@rustbot` will ignore commands in markdown code blocks, inline code spans, HTML blocks, or blockquotes.",
      "source_hash": 14496517182195417291,
      "context_hash": 14489912667643654463,
      "translation": "GitHub 이슈나 풀 리퀘스트에서의 명령은 보통 댓글 어디에든 `@rustbot`을 쓰고 뒤에 명령을 이어 작성하여 실행합니다. `@rustbot`은 마크다운 코드 블록, 인라인 코드 스팬, HTML 블록, 인용구 안에 있는 명령은 무시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602171Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Multiple rustbot commands can be entered in a single comment.",
      "source_hash": 7350335668380525732,
      "context_hash": 18217205093275014038,
      "translation": "하나의 댓글에 여러 개의 rustbot 명령을 입력할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "rustbot": "rustbot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962779Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Triagebot also allows editing of a comment.",
      "source_hash": 18433257471398636649,
      "context_hash": 10083207723547300284,
      "translation": "Triagebot은 댓글 수정도 허용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962779Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "If you don't modify the text of the command, then triagebot will ignore the edit.",
      "source_hash": 15109302783154048639,
      "context_hash": 16490661360266939688,
      "translation": "명령의 텍스트를 수정하지 않으면 triagebot은 수정 사항을 무시합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "However, if you modify an existing command, or add new ones, then those commands will be processed.",
      "source_hash": 8219873382442459462,
      "context_hash": 13494125093582970619,
      "translation": "하지만 기존 명령을 수정하거나 새로운 명령을 추가하면 해당 명령이 처리됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Zulip commands",
      "source_hash": 16838381296001576213,
      "context_hash": 1260831650323447842,
      "translation": "Zulip 명령",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Commands on Zulip are either issued by sending a direct message to the [triagebot](https://rust-lang.zulipchat.com/#narrow/dm/261224-triagebot) account, or by pinging `@triagebot` on a Zulip stream and specifying a command that will then be executed within that stream.",
      "source_hash": 9307962404132232741,
      "context_hash": 10807295162968064126,
      "translation": "Zulip에서의 명령은 [triagebot](https://rust-lang.zulipchat.com/#narrow/dm/261224-triagebot) 계정에 다이렉트 메시지를 보내거나, Zulip 스트림에서 `@triagebot`을 핑하고 명령을 지정하면 해당 스트림 내에서 실행되는 방식으로 발행됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip",
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962780Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "You can find the documentation of triagebot Zulip commands [here](zulip-commands.md).",
      "source_hash": 11494957164901954178,
      "context_hash": 2423081133872201631,
      "translation": "triagebot Zulip 명령에 대한 문서는 [여기](zulip-commands.md)에서 찾을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Zulip": "Zulip",
        "triagebot": "triagebot"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Configuration",
      "source_hash": 4935613502183038470,
      "context_hash": 5977817281100683487,
      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Individual GitHub repositories can configure triagebot features via a file called `triagebot.toml` in the root of the default branch.",
      "source_hash": 16429603172203208260,
      "context_hash": 3538446089730725514,
      "translation": "개별 GitHub 저장소는 기본 브랜치의 루트에 있는 `triagebot.toml`이라는 파일을 통해 triagebot 기능을 설정할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "triagebot": "triagebot",
        "default branch": "기본 브랜치"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The following pages explain the syntax needed for each feature.",
      "source_hash": 6287378034928360579,
      "context_hash": 10535253576644185952,
      "translation": "다음 페이지에서는 각 기능에 필요한 문법을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "For example, the `rust-lang/rust` configuration file is at <https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/triagebot.toml>.",
      "source_hash": 10979079656414352165,
      "context_hash": 17463969731023990857,
      "translation": "예를 들어 `rust-lang/rust`의 설정 파일은 <https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/HEAD/triagebot.toml>에 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "When first adding `triagebot.toml` to a new repository, you will need to enable permissions for the bot to operate.",
      "source_hash": 11784498402584395202,
      "context_hash": 16748991550341942790,
      "translation": "새 저장소에 `triagebot.toml`을 처음 추가할 때는 봇이 동작할 수 있도록 권한을 활성화해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "This can be done by posting a PR to the [`rust-lang/team`](https://github.com/rust-lang/team) database to add `bots = [\"rustbot\"]` to the repository in the `repos/rust-lang` directory.",
      "source_hash": 14370198604436667375,
      "context_hash": 4931941539827216603,
      "translation": "이는 [`rust-lang/team`](https://github.com/rust-lang/team) 데이터베이스에 PR을 올려 `repos/rust-lang` 디렉터리 내 해당 저장소에 `bots = [\"rustbot\"]`을 추가하는 방식으로 할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Global configuration",
      "source_hash": 3104341484150896157,
      "context_hash": 5817698885183952833,
      "translation": "전역 설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602172Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "GitHub organizations can have a global configuration that applies to all repositories in the organization.",
      "source_hash": 10288450188790126539,
      "context_hash": 5733233363718737450,
      "translation": "GitHub 조직은 해당 조직의 모든 저장소에 적용되는 전역 설정을 가질 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602173Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "The rust-lang global configuration is located at <https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml>.",
      "source_hash": 8003774232386642230,
      "context_hash": 9174079894281362952,
      "translation": "rust-lang의 전역 설정은 <https://github.com/rust-lang/triagebot/blob/master/rust-lang.triagebot.toml>에 위치합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The configuration options in the global configuration are the same as in a normal `triagebot.toml` file, except that each configuration entry can include an `excluded-repos = [\"rust-lang/foo\"]` option that disables that feature for the specified repositories.",
      "source_hash": 1164514348901402227,
      "context_hash": 13769737750186824682,
      "translation": "전역 설정의 설정 옵션은 일반 `triagebot.toml` 파일과 동일하지만, 각 설정 항목에 `excluded-repos = [\"rust-lang/foo\"]` 옵션을 포함하여 지정된 저장소에서 해당 기능을 비활성화할 수 있다는 점이 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602173Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Common command summary",
      "source_hash": 13165327077545195696,
      "context_hash": 4225745012396430121,
      "translation": "자주 쓰이는 명령 요약",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T12:47:36.602173Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The following are some common commands you may see on [rust-lang/rust](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/).",
      "source_hash": 2551941459022716240,
      "context_hash": 12879959566000288606,
      "translation": "다음은 [rust-lang/rust](https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/)에서 볼 수 있는 몇 가지 일반적인 명령입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Rust": "Rust"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-04T13:17:44.962781Z",
      "issues": []
    },
